{"id": "EUVD-2026-72755", "enisaUuid": "96191600-b441-318c-bb67-b3b48b3b5865", "description": "XenForo before 2.3.13 contains a missing authorization vulnerability in the force-agreement controller that allows any ACP administrator to access and submit force-agreement forms regardless of their assigned permissions. Attackers can bypass the option permission declared in the navigation configuration to update the global policy last-updated timestamp, forcing all users to re-agree to the privacy policy or terms of service.", "datePublished": "2026-09-08T13:19:14", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-01T15:20:37", "baseScore": 5.1, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:H/UI:N/VC:N/VI:L/VA:L/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://xenforo.com/community/threads/security-fixes-released-for-all-xenforo-and-media-gallery-versions-2-2-0-2-3-12.239856/", "https://xenforo.com/community/threads/xenforo-2-3-13-and-add-ons-released-includes-security-fixes.239857/", "https://bombobombone.github.io/posts/cve-2026-73318/", "https://github.com/BomboBombone/CVE-2026-73318", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/xenforo-missing-authorization-via-force-agreement-controller"], "aliases": ["GHSA-gw9m-qhxg-fr69", "CVE-2026-73318"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.49, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "c1808f0a-7d73-3ffa-a812-1595e7c58251", "product": {"name": "Xenforo", "vendor": {"name": "Xenforo"}}, "product_version": "0 <2.3.13"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "cce7ecff-7b0e-35c5-b8b2-3c1cac406191", "vendor": {"name": "Xenforo"}}], "isExploited": false}